// OtherCreaturesYouControl = the anthem-family distribution set: "other
// creatures you control" ([CR#613.6] anthem shape) — the plural-collective
// oracle wording, matched by exact case-insensitive subject text (no
// singularize/pluralize normalization). A Selection-kind macro — the whole
// `SelectAll(...)` IS the macro body, so a card spells the anthem as
// `Each(OtherCreaturesYouControl, Modify(It, <boost>))` directly, no nested
// `SelectAll` at the call site. Nests the reusable `OtherCreatureYouControl`
// Predicate atom rather than repeating its `And([...])` filter inline.
(
    name: "OtherCreaturesYouControl",
    template: "other creatures you control",
    kinds: [Selection],
    body: SelectAll(OtherCreatureYouControl),
)
